Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.52,0:00:06.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know that you're thinking I really don't need to,\Nbut I want to say it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.52,0:00:07.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.81,0:00:15.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I love you, Kiriyama Yui-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.61,0:00:15.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will you go out with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.07,0:00:18.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hold on, what's this all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.41,0:00:20.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I already turned you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.12,0:00:22.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But my feelings haven't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.08,0:00:25.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you can always change y—\NNo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.75,0:00:27.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.33,0:00:30.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.92,0:00:33.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Yet"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.92,0:00:34.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know, I've always been curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.30,0:00:38.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.05,0:00:38.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iori's a lot cuter than I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.51,0:00:41.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and Inaba's just plain beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.51,0:00:42.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's plenty of good things about you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.06,0:00:45.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it's mostly just a feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.73,0:00:51.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I met you, I knew I would fall in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.86,0:00:51.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I did fall in love with you.{Correct this in previous preview.}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.07,0:00:55.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.67,0:02:35.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why'd you pick a time like this to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.67,0:02:38.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yui, how do you feel about Taichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.63,0:02:38.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,About Taichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.84,0:02:42.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...\NI love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.64,0:02:45.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.97,0:02:48.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A-And what about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.77,0:02:50.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hate you as a friend.\NNo way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.77,0:02:52.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm obviously joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.85,0:02:56.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I probably love you more than I hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.85,0:02:56.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But just as a friend! A {\i1}friend{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.61,0:03:03.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's as much as I can say right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.65,0:03:03.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.62,0:03:10.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not that I don't like you.\NI just can't go out with anyone right now.{She's confused. Taichi or Aoki? GO WITH AOKI. YOU MAKE SUCH A GOOD COUPLE WITH HIM.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.66,0:03:15.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a relief. So I still have a chance!\NIs that all you wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.50,0:03:20.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go back and have lunch.\NIs that an invitation to eat with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.76,0:03:22.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.\NI have friends waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.68,0:03:25.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.68,0:03:29.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And just so you know, Taichi ranks way higher than you on my male friend list.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.81,0:03:31.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How'd you know about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.56,0:03:31.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{overlap}What?! I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.31,0:03:33.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi's my biggest rival!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.31,0:03:35.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I switched with Yui yesterday, I saw a text from Aoki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.90,0:03:38.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Accidentally, of course.\NSo,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.57,0:03:42.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought it might be good to give you two some {\i1}stimulation{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.57,0:03:45.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Stimulation"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.53,0:03:48.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, what you do next is up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.54,0:03:56.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See you.\NLet's go back too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.58,0:04:01.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.81,0:04:10.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just you, Taichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.81,0:04:12.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.43,0:04:15.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you Inaba?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.31,0:04:15.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.81,0:04:20.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iori and I switched bodies.\NSo...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.23,0:04:24.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,what did you think about Aoki and Yui at lunch?\NWhat did I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.99,0:04:29.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It felt like they were in a different world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.99,0:04:33.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaba, what were you hoping to accomplish by showing us that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.49,0:04:38.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you really can't figure it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.08,0:04:38.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.08,0:04:43.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whatever. I'll get right to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.59,0:04:47.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi, how do you feel about Iori?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.38,0:04:51.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You just keep slinging these blunt questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.18,0:04:56.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And asking this one from Nagase's body is just...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.97,0:04:56.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Perfect timing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.19,0:04:58.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's perfect about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.19,0:05:01.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.35,0:05:06.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I really like the way we are right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.40,0:05:09.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to ruin it, but—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.12,0:05:11.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, just you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.99,0:05:16.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaban, that was too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.00,0:05:21.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I tricked you, silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.84,0:05:24.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iori!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.30,0:05:26.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi, what the hell did you do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.30,0:05:28.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.38,0:05:31.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagase pretended she switched with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.30,0:05:31.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pretended she switched? Why would she?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.68,0:05:34.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know why eith—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.31,0:05:37.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No matter what happens...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.31,0:05:40.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}no matter who you pretend to be...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.52,0:05:44.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll always know who you are.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.53,0:05:50.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like you {\i1}do{\i0} know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.53,0:05:54.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and that I'm a complete idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.78,0:05:58.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She wanted to trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.87,0:05:58.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Need a good punch to the face?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.25,0:06:01.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, could y—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.04,0:06:04.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up and go after her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.96,0:06:08.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is between you and her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.56,0:06:14.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fujishima!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.35,0:06:15.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yaegashi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.89,0:06:17.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you seen Nagase?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.89,0:06:25.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it's the way of the world for couples to only be a man and a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.27,0:06:25.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.27,0:06:27.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for that kind of talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.32,0:06:29.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I need to find Nagase—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.99,0:06:31.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way, Fuji—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.74,0:06:35.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagase-san ran out the main gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.20,0:06:38.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She didn't need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.16,0:06:45.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure the one Nagase-san needs is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.33,0:06:45.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fujishima, are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.05,0:06:52.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're who Nagase-san needs right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.88,0:06:52.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,then of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.88,0:06:55.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.18,0:06:57.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nagase,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.85,0:07:02.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}where are you?\N{\i1}Nagase!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.32,0:07:11.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagase!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.78,0:07:14.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.95,0:07:17.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that I didn't realize it was you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.08,0:07:24.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I even promised you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.63,0:07:30.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are people? What is the "self"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.63,0:07:36.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So long as you look like someone else, no one can tell who's really on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.59,0:07:39.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's not like I'm trying to make you feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.64,0:07:39.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This was definitely all my fault, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.93,0:07:43.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.93,0:07:47.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}But that's because you wanted\N to try moving on, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.48,0:07:51.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.94,0:07:55.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And now, it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.24,0:07:55.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.24,0:07:59.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How should I put this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.24,0:08:03.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I really wish I could be more like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.99,0:08:03.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,More like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.83,0:08:08.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't show my emotions the way you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.50,0:08:11.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Being happy, being angry, being sad...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.09,0:08:17.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why I wish I could be more like you and show that I'm enjoying my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.51,0:08:21.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's just me putting on different personalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.10,0:08:24.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You said that the other day, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.89,0:08:31.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But were you really just pretending?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.06,0:08:31.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.15,0:08:34.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.57,0:08:38.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe there's something you didn't understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.57,0:08:44.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Screwing around, playing innocent, getting embarrassed, telling dirty jokes...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.12,0:08:46.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Going along with any joke, but actually planning it all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.83,0:08:52.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not thinking some things through, yet completely overthinking other things.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.42,0:08:54.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Telling jokes before a serious talk so it doesn't look like you're embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.51,0:08:57.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And sometimes looking like you don't feel anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.18,0:08:59.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.22,0:09:01.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're all you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.22,0:09:03.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What part of that is me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.93,0:09:05.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're all Nagase Iori!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.31,0:09:10.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A person like that can't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.56,0:09:10.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No one has that many faces!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.02,0:09:13.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd say that it's totally normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.02,0:09:15.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone has different faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.32,0:09:18.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't have many.\NYou have a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.91,0:09:22.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that all it boils down to?\NBut I change mine depending on who—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.83,0:09:28.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone changes how they act depending on who's around them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.12,0:09:31.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I tell myself that I'm going with a certain personality!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.50,0:09:33.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think people can deal with others without telling themselves what to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.75,0:09:38.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I can even change what I like depending on the mood!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.59,0:09:38.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I couldn't even choose a club for myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.80,0:09:40.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That just means you like a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.76,0:09:47.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q0}And not choosing a club is no different than joining a club that looked easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.39,0:09:47.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't prove any of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.69,0:09:51.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.69,0:09:54.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Starting somewhere in the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.53,0:10:03.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.79,0:10:09.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wish I could be more like you too.\NYou know exactly who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.46,0:10:18.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter who I pretend to be, you'll always be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.21,0:10:22.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wish I could be someone who could make people feel secure like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.30,0:10:22.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagase.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.35,0:10:24.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I love you, Nagase Iori.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.81,0:10:29.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will you go out with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.12,0:10:46.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.12,0:10:54.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello. Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.12,0:10:57.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've probably already realized this, but I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.13,0:10:57.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Balloon Vine?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.34,0:11:00.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.34,0:11:05.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll apologize ahead of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.22,0:11:05.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.14,0:11:09.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the fault lies with all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.14,0:11:13.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're all much too interesting.{Sorry if this is a dumb question, but isn't "amari omoshirosugiru" the opposite of this line?}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.66,0:11:26.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait... What are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.24,0:11:32.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've already apologized.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.59,0:11:36.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagase!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.89,0:11:53.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.27,0:11:55.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's Gossan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.61,0:11:59.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He'll be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.61,0:12:01.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like they got a hold of Iori's mom too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.32,0:12:05.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.99,0:12:10.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You...\NWhat do you want now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.24,0:12:14.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagase Iori-san's body will die soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.00,0:12:17.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.63,0:12:20.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you saying you can control people's lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.88,0:12:23.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.63,0:12:32.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I can know exactly what the reality of the situation is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.64,0:12:36.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who would believe anything you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.77,0:12:43.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whether you believe me or not is your choice to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.90,0:12:46.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now then...\NAre you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.03,0:12:49.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.66,0:12:57.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd like you all to decide whose personality will die with Nagase-san's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.54,0:13:01.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.17,0:13:05.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For the next 30 minutes, I'll make it so that
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.05,0:13:10.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you can switch personalities at will by stating who switches with whom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.31,0:13:13.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.18,0:13:14.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.02,0:13:17.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our lives are not your toys!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.23,0:13:20.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.11,0:13:25.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?\NYour 30-minute window starts now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.49,0:13:38.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Basically,\Nhe's telling us to choose who to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.50,0:13:42.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I don't want Iori to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.34,0:13:45.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The doctors are doing everything they can too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.26,0:13:48.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. He could've been lying,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.72,0:13:50.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but there's also a chance he wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.30,0:13:54.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Either way, we have to deal with the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.31,0:13:56.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whether we like it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.35,0:14:03.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If...\NIf someone has to be a sacrifice,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.23,0:14:05.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,then I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.90,0:14:09.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut the hell up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.32,0:14:11.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who asked you to be a sacrifice?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.03,0:14:15.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you ever stopped to think about the people you're sacrificing yourself for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.33,0:14:19.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You may {\i1}look{\i0} like you're thinking about others,\Nbut you're really only thinking about yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.04,0:14:22.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a selfish freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.38,0:14:24.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, {\i1}sorry{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.05,0:14:29.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I hate seeing people getting hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.34,0:14:31.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I imagine how they'll suffer,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.01,0:14:35.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it just gets worse and worse!\NIt hurts me more than anything else!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.22,0:14:38.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hate that!\NIt's better if I get hurt instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.35,0:14:41.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At least I know how much it'll hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.35,0:14:43.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can put up with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.31,0:14:47.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're right.\NI'm not doing it for anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.44,0:14:52.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm being a selfless freak for myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.99,0:14:58.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.\NYou really {\i1}are{\i0} crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.08,0:15:06.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're crazy,\Nbut you're crazy in a nice way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.80,0:15:11.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You want to help, but you can only hurt yourself. You're such an idiot. Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.43,0:15:16.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you should know how much it hurts us then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.35,0:15:22.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think that Iori-chan has to die with her body.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.81,0:15:24.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.81,0:15:27.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to say it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.44,0:15:32.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but someone had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.82,0:15:38.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Either way, we need to tell Iori-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.83,0:15:40.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.62,0:15:43.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I made the suggestion, so I'll switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.42,0:15:50.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I, Aoki Yoshifumi, want to switch with Nagase Iori.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.26,0:15:56.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um...\NWhy are you all here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.85,0:16:01.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was just on the bridge, talking to Taichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.52,0:16:04.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iori,\Ntry to stay calm and listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.02,0:16:06.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.08,0:16:28.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then...\NI guess I'll just have to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.00,0:16:31.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagase, it doesn't have to be that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.38,0:16:33.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It can't be any other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.30,0:16:38.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Killing another personality and taking their body is a sin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.31,0:16:42.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One too heavy for me to live with.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.73,0:16:44.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's my mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.10,0:16:47.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's on her way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.52,0:16:50.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.\NUm...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.11,0:16:58.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I... have a word with each of you before I go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.94,0:17:31.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi...\NIori wants to talk to you next.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.07,0:17:34.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yo, Taichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.69,0:17:36.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nagase.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.82,0:17:40.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? You look the same as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.28,0:17:42.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't show much emotion, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.66,0:17:46.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,First of all, Taichi...\NThanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.33,0:17:52.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My problems don't seem as grave after talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.25,0:17:56.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It feels like I can actually love myself now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.55,0:18:01.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You said that you love me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.76,0:18:04.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to respond to your feelings now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.77,0:18:10.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But wouldn't you like to hear a joke before that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.52,0:18:14.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not really, but I thought you might tell one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.99,0:18:21.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can you act so much like you always do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.45,0:18:24.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone else was really sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.16,0:18:27.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sad too.\NSo sad I could die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.62,0:18:30.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you're sadder than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.42,0:18:34.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I cried, you couldn't cry yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.60,0:18:47.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.47,0:18:51.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to keep living.\NI had so much to look forward to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.02,0:18:56.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?\NWhy does this have to happen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.78,0:18:59.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did I do wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.86,0:19:03.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You even told me that you love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.58,0:19:10.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I love you too, Taichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.25,0:19:14.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So please, don't go out with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.05,0:19:19.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm going to die soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.05,0:19:23.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't be good for you to go out with me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.68,0:19:25.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think that m—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.93,0:19:29.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Instead, give me a memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.73,0:19:34.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe we...\Ncould kiss?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.65,0:19:40.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Inaban will forgive us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.29,0:19:55.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's time for your answer.\NWho will it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.71,0:19:58.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.59,0:20:01.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagase Iori will die with Nagase Iori's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.55,0:20:06.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, that's the obvious choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.55,0:20:08.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I ask you one last question?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.18,0:20:12.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is something I have to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.31,0:20:15.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You won't do this to anyone else, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.73,0:20:19.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.57,0:20:22.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.15,0:20:25.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iori?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.91,0:20:34.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait...\N{\i1}Don't tell me it's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.54,0:20:40.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We were very lucky.\NShe's okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.05,0:20:46.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There shouldn't be any permanent damage.\NWe'll let you see her soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.56,0:20:55.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone.\NThank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.06,0:20:59.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have these.\NIt's my way of apologizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.52,0:21:03.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's also for Nagase-san when she wakes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.40,0:21:07.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've been had...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.57,0:21:10.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought it was a possibility, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.37,0:21:13.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then Iori's safe?\NShe's alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.37,0:21:16.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.88,0:21:21.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How much of this was planned?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.75,0:21:29.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, you could say it was planned from start to finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.76,0:21:29.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's how the story goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.76,0:21:35.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think we can do a lot more than you think we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.52,0:21:39.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't plan on hurting Nagase at all from the start?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.98,0:21:45.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't cause that kind of trouble for a normal, good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.40,0:21:50.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I even made sure her cell phone didn't get wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.78,0:21:54.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't ask you to forgive me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.04,0:21:58.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I hope you won't hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.79,0:22:03.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all, this experience was to your benefit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.80,0:22:09.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Until next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.44,0:22:28.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.70,0:22:29.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.82,0:22:32.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry to make you worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.53,0:22:34.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No need to sweat that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.91,0:22:38.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did anything else weird happen to you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.08,0:22:41.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.08,0:22:44.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We haven't switched personalities since.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.25,0:22:47.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like it's all over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.84,0:22:49.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.97,0:22:51.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For now, let's just eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.89,0:22:53.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aoki, make some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.68,0:22:55.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay! Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.26,0:22:56.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have a seat, Iori-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.02,0:22:59.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.\NI kind of feel bad, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.60,0:23:01.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, Taichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.81,0:23:03.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaba!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.27,0:23:04.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.61,0:23:07.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.61,0:23:09.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I went to visit Iori, she told me...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.78,0:23:15.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like you took my first kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.03,0:23:19.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How{\i0} should I make you pay me back?
